            "Message": "In this example, you should focus only on whether the final word library is a natural interpretation of the picture.\n\nYou should not judge whether the picture proves that the person is a woman or whether she \"needed\" to do something. Instead, treat the rest of the sentence as given and judge only whether the sentence ending fits the situation shown.",
